# CODEOWNERS — the human-authored repo-to-root surface of this VPS.
#
# Anything listed here can execute code as root on the server via the deploy
# path (see scaffold/docs/05-access-model.md, "The Repo-to-Root Trust
# Boundary"), so it always requires an owner's review. Enable "Require review
# from Code Owners" in branch protection for this to be enforced.
#
# Deliberately NOT listed: compose files, workflow action pins and the
# scaffold submodule pointer. Renovate automerges digest/pointer bumps to
# those, and their guard is CI + the 3-day minimumReleaseAge cooldown — adding
# them here would silently disable the hands-off update path. Structural
# (non-bot) changes to those files still get normal PR review.
#
# Replace @uppertoe with this repo's actual owner(s)/team.

# Deploy hooks run as root on the VPS and are only ever human-authored.
apps/*/deploy.sh   @uppertoe

# Renovate config controls what may automerge at all.
renovate.json5     @uppertoe

# CODEOWNERS itself.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @uppertoe
